	(text "T24-10 tile  -  2-layer standard\nProject > Project Settings > Text Variables: set TILE_FAMILY, TILE_VARIANT, TILE_REV.\nPads P1..P10 are the tile base pads (bottom side). Delete a no-connect flag to use a pad.\nStandard pinout (inferred from T44-10 (no T24 tile in the symbol library yet)): P1=GND, P4=I2C.CLK, P5=I2C.DAT, P10=+V.\nFab: Standard calculator: 2 layers / 0.4 mm / 4/4 mil / min hole 0.2 mm / ENIG / tenting"
